WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:02.953
Time passed.

2
00:00:02.954 --> 00:00:06.807
Robot kept thinking about MechaTron.

3
00:00:06.808 --> 00:00:12.072
"I can't fly or fight," he thought.

4
00:00:12.073 --> 00:00:16.541
"So how can I be awesome like MechaTron?"

5
00:00:16.542 --> 00:00:19.499
Suddenly Robot had an idea.

6
00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:28.396
"I know who to ask."

7
00:00:28.397 --> 00:00:31.567
He hurried into the playroom.

8
00:00:31.568 --> 00:00:34.722
It was very noisy.

9
00:00:34.723 --> 00:00:38.349
"Horse!" Robot called.

10
00:00:38.350 --> 00:00:46.113
Noly ran over. "Hi, Robot! Want to play?"

11
00:00:46.114 --> 00:00:50.866
Robot ignored Noly as Horse came over.

12
00:00:50.867 --> 00:00:53.923
"Hello, Robot," Horse said.

13
00:00:53.924 --> 00:00:56.135
"How can I help you?"

14
00:00:56.136 --> 00:01:00.019
"Well . . ." Robot snapped his claw.

15
00:01:00.020 --> 00:01:05.245
"As you know, I'm the coolest toy here."

16
00:01:05.246 --> 00:01:08.191
"That's true!" Noly said.

17
00:01:08.192 --> 00:01:12.998
Horse slowly nodded. "Uh-huh."

18
00:01:12.999 --> 00:01:18.680
"But there's another robot named MechaTron," Robot said.

19
00:01:18.681 --> 00:01:23.269
"He flies and fights and saves people."

20
00:01:23.270 --> 00:01:25.862
"Yes?" Horse said.

21
00:01:25.863 --> 00:01:30.107
"I want to be a hero like him," Robot said.

22
00:01:30.108 --> 00:01:32.997
"I see," Horse said.

23
00:01:32.998 --> 00:01:38.856
"Well, for toys, there's one way to be a hero," Horse said.

24
00:01:38.857 --> 00:01:42.241
"Great!" Robot said. "What is it?"

25
00:01:42.242 --> 00:01:45.727
"All you have to do is—"

26
00:01:45.728 --> 00:01:48.695
"Yes, Horse?" Robot said.

27
00:01:48.696 --> 00:01:53.640
Horse smiled. "Make a child happy."

28
00:01:53.641 --> 00:01:59.703
"Huh?" Robot said. "But heroes fly and fight!

29
00:01:59.704 --> 00:02:03.364
They're tough and powerful."

30
00:02:03.365 --> 00:02:07.668
"Not all heroes," Horse said.

31
00:02:07.669 --> 00:02:13.050
"Bah!" Robot stomped his foot.

32
00:02:13.051 --> 00:02:15.312
"This is silly."

33
00:02:15.313 --> 00:02:19.913
"You thought Rabbit's wish was silly," Horse said.

34
00:02:19.914 --> 00:02:24.301
"But remember what I said about the fairy?"

35
00:02:24.302 --> 00:02:27.810
"Yes," Robot said.

36
00:02:27.811 --> 00:02:33.396
Horse thought a fairy made Rabbit's wish come true.

37
00:02:33.397 --> 00:02:38.282
And now Rabbit was a real rabbit.

38
00:02:38.283 --> 00:02:43.818
"Hmm," Robot said. "Maybe I can try making a wish.

39
00:02:43.819 --> 00:02:47.093
Then I'll look for that fairy."

40
00:02:47.094 --> 00:02:52.466
"Wow!" Noly said. "You're so smart!"

41
00:02:52.467 --> 00:02:56.557
"Sure, you can try it," Horse said.

42
00:02:56.558 --> 00:02:58.953
"But remember, Robot.

43
00:02:58.954 --> 00:03:09.674
Things don't always go how we expect."

